//! conforms: mem.region.edge.elem, mem.tier0.move.3, type.map
//!
//! wolf-lang#438 (ruled "align" 2026-09-24; parked by s182, landed by
//! s180) — the `Map` twin of `index_store_copies_list.lu`:
//! `m["k"] = xs` copies, `xs` stays live and grows alone. Before s180:
//! `fail(E1001)` on both wolfgang lanes, `trap(use-after-move)` on
